&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgMM7inueBmpa54fYtQwn4of&quot;&gt;As an Infra Product Manager focused on Algorithm and Search, you will be responsible for the deep, high-quality delivery of core Web3 Infra components — primarily the algorithm platform, search system, and related AI capabilities that serve Wallet, DEX, and other businesses. You will work closely with engineering, data, and data science teams to ensure that core problems are solved correctly, that products meet stringent performance, accuracy, and scalability bars, and that every release is reliable and production-grade. This role demands strong execution discipline, technical depth, and the ability to drive complex algorithmic and search problems from design through delivery.&lt;/div&gt;
